<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Exposes uvec1 vector type.</para>

<para>Include &lt;glm/ext/vector_uvec1.hpp&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>See also</title>

<para><link linkend="_group__ext__vector__int1">GLM_EXT_vector_int1</link> extension. </para>

<para>ext_vector_uint1_precision extension.</para>
</formalpara>
</para>
